":"If there is a profit, it represents the amount of profit; otherwise, it is 0."}},"getNetAssets()":{"details":"Retrieve the amount of assets in all lending protocols involved in this contract for the strategy pool.","returns":{"_0":"netAssets The total amount of net assets."}},"getNetAssetsInfo()":{"details":"Retrieve the amount of assets in all lending protocols involved in this contract for the strategy pool.","returns":{"_0":"totalAssets The total amount of collateral.","_1":"totalDebt The total amount of debt.","_2":"netAssets The total amount of net assets.","_3":"aggregatedRatio The aggregate collateral-to-debt ratio."}},"getProtocolAccountData(uint8)":{"details":"Retrieve the collateral and debt quantities of this strategy pool in the lending protocol.","params":{"_protocolId":"The index of the lending protocol within this contract."},"returns":{"debtEthAmount":"The amount of ETH debt.","stEthAmount":"The amount of stETH collateral."}},"getProtocolCollateralRatio(uint8)":{"details":"Retrieve the debt collateralization ratio of this strategy pool in the lending protocol, using the oracle associated with that lending protocol.","params":{"_protocolId":"The index of the lending protocol within this contract."},"returns":{"collateralRatio":"The debt collateralization ratio, where 1e18 represents 100%.","isOK":"This bool indicates whether the safe collateralization ratio has been exceeded. If true, it indicates the need for a deleveraging operation."}},"getProtocolLeverageAmount(uint8,bool,uint256)":{"details":"Retrieve the amount of WETH required for the flash loan in this operation. When increasing leverage, it is also possible to deposit stETH into the lending protocol simultaneously. When decreasing leverage, it is also possible to withdraw stETH from the lending protocol simultaneously.","params":{"_depositOrWithdraw":"The amount of stETH to be deposited or withdrawn.","_isDepositOrWithdraw":"Whether an additional deposit of stETH is required.","_protocolId":"The index of the lending protocol within this contract."},"returns":{"amount":"The amount of flash loan required for this transaction.","isLeverage":"Returning \"true\" indicates the need to increase leverage, while returning \"false\" indicates the need to decrease leverage."}},"getProtocolNetAssets(uint8)":{"details":"Retrieve the amount of net assets in the protocol.","params":{"_protocolId":"The index of the lending protocol within this contract."},"returns":{"net":"The amount of net assets."}},"getProtocolRatio(uint8)":{"details":"Retrieve the ratio of debt to collateral, considering stETH and ETH as assets with a 1:1 ratio.","params":{"_protocolId":"The index of the lending protocol within this contract."},"returns":{"ratio":"The debt collateralization ratio, where 1e18 represents 100%."}},"getVersion()":{"details":"Retrieve the version number of the strategy pool."},"initialize(uint256,uint256,uint256[],address[],address,address,address)":{"details":"Initialize various parameters of the strategy pool.","params":{"_feeReceiver":"The address of the recipient for performance fees.","_flashloanHelper":"The address of the intermediary contract used for executing flash loan operations.","_lendingLogic":"The logic contract for executing lending operations.","_rebalancers":"The whitelist addresses allowed to perform position adjustments.","_revenueRate":"The percentage of performance fees collected.","_safeAggregatedRatio":"The safe aggregate collateralization ratio.","_safeProtocolRatio":"The safe target collateralization ratio corresponding to the lending protocol."}},"owner()":{"details":"Returns the address of the current owner."},"renounceOwnership()":{"details":"Leaves the contract without owner. It will not be possible to call `onlyOwner` functions. Can only be called by the current owner. NOTE: Renouncing ownership will leave the contract without an owner, thereby disabling any functionality that is only available to the owner."},"setVault(address)":{"deta